* Native TRAN Cobo: 10 V / 1 MHz; no .ac or thermal substitution
V_TEST c 0 SIN(10 0.001 1000000)
R_EOPEN e 0 1T
Q_TEST c 0 e FJP5027_DC25_CANDIDATE_V2
* DC calibration candidate; not a vendor model. See extraction provenance.
* Fit domain: DC at 25 C. Full-temperature and dynamic acceptance remain separate.
* TF/TR/CJE/CJC are retained unless explicitly changed in a later charge extraction.
* No avalanche, secondary breakdown, SOA failure or self-heating is implemented.
.model FJP5027_DC25_CANDIDATE_V2 NPN(
+ IS=1.4908513064334e-13 NF=1 BF=19.8835210290589 IKF=2.62950900106785 VAF=14.0085477252184
+ ISE=1e-12 NE=1.5 BR=8.06723462981205 NR=1 IKR=99.9888393913173
+ VAR=7.19150042273564 ISC=1e-12 NC=1.5 RB=0.138721898753965 RBM=0.138721898753965
+ IRB=0.01 RC=0.0876422087685555 RE=0.000399005844279684 CJE=2e-09 VJE=0.75
+ MJE=0.33 CJC=1.4446e-10 VJC=0.75 MJC=0.33 TF=1e-08
+ TR=3e-07 XTB=1.1 EG=1.11 XTI=3 TNOM=25
+ NK=0.668756459260162)

.temp 25
.options reltol=1e-6 abstol=1e-14 vntol=1e-9
B_PROJECTION proj 0 V={I(V_TEST)*cos(2*pi*1Meg*time)}
.tran 0 2e-05 0 2.5e-09
.meas TRAN COBO_COS INTEG V(proj) FROM=1e-05 TO=2e-05
.end
